# Cases for rules/1003-linux-system.xml. The FIM rules (100300-100303) can't
# be replayed by wazuh-logtest: they are checked live by tests/e2e.sh
# (scenario persistence). The disconnection rule (W5.6) can.

case sensor agent disconnected (naming sensor-*)
expect rule=100400 level=10 groups=asox,agent_disconnected
log ossec: Agent disconnected: 'sensor-suricata-any'.

case server agent disconnected (naming srv-*)
expect rule=100400 level=10
log ossec: Agent disconnected: 'srv-web01-any'.

case desktop agent disconnected stays at the built-in level
expect rule=504 level=3
expect not=100400
log ossec: Agent disconnected: 'YOGA-any'.
